### Display

- The addresses, 10 to a page, with their type, name, street, second street line, postcode, city and country, sorted by the column clicked — [reads](aim:juicebar.entities#Record:Customer), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.details#Requirements[ADDRLIST]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTCOUNTRY])
- "Add new address" for staff with the `update` permission — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.details#Requirements[ADDRADD]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTROLE])

### Actions

- Add new address — [navigates](aim:juicebar.entities.details#View:AddAddressDialog)
- Edit address — [navigates](aim:juicebar.entities.details#View:EditAddressDialog)

### Layout

- "Add new address" is the page's action; edit is an icon button on each row.

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/details/address-entity/address-entity.component.ts#AddressEntityComponent` — as: component
- provenance: inferred

