## Operation: UpdateCustomer

### Summary

A staff member saves a customer's details.

### Input

```schema
customerId: string required ref(juicebar.entities#Customer.id)
type: string
salutation: string
sex: string
title: string
firstname: string
lastname: string
name: string
taxNumber: string
email: string
phone: string
mobilephone: string
phoneCallingNumber: string
mobilephoneCallingNumber: string
groups: list(juicebar.entities#CustomerGroup)
languages: list(string)
country: string
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerEditor`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerAdmin`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerSuperAdmin`

### Ensures

- The customer's salutation, title, gender, names, tax number, phones, e-mail address, type, groups and languages are stored as given; a text field given empty keeps its stored value, and the calling numbers are kept with the attributes — [mutates](aim:juicebar.entities#Record:Customer), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.details#Requirements[DETSAVE])
- Where the country differs from the first address's, that address is stored again with the new country — [mutates](aim:juicebar.entities#Record:Customer), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.details#Requirements[DETSAVE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTCOUNTRY])
- "Customer successfully updated" shows; a refusal shows the backend's reason — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.details#Requirements[DETSAVE])
- The backend refuses it without the `update` permission, and for a customer of another organisation — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTROLE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar#Requirements[ROLES]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTORG])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/details/details-entity/details-entity.component.ts#DetailsEntityComponent.update` — as: component
- binds: `service:entities#updateEntity` — as: handler
- binds: `service:entities#updateAddress` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred

## Operation: AddAddress

### Summary

A staff member adds an address to a customer.

### Input

```schema
customerId: string required ref(juicebar.entities#Customer.id)
type: string required
name: string
street: string required
postcode: string required
city: string required
country: string required
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerEditor`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerAdmin`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerSuperAdmin`

### Ensures

- The address is added to the customer's addresses, active, and the list is read again — [mutates](aim:juicebar.entities#Record:Customer), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.details#Requirements[ADDRADD])
- The backend refuses it without the `update` permission, and for a customer of another organisation — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTROLE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTORG])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/details/address-entity/address-dialog.component.ts#AddressDialogComponent.save` — as: component
- binds: `service:entities#addAddress` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred

## Operation: UpdateAddress

### Summary

A staff member changes one address of a customer.

### Input

```schema
customerId: string required ref(juicebar.entities#Customer.id)
addressId: string required
type: string required
name: string
street: string required
street2: string
postcode: string required
city: string required
country: string required
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerEditor`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerAdmin`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerSuperAdmin`

### Ensures

- The fields given replace those of the address with that id; its other fields stay — [mutates](aim:juicebar.entities#Record:Customer), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.details#Requirements[ADDREDIT])
- The backend refuses it without the `update` permission, and for a customer of another organisation — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTROLE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTORG])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/details/address-entity/address-dialog.component.ts#AddressDialogComponent.save` — as: component
- binds: `service:entities#updateAddress` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred
